@startuml blog-content-system-class
' Primary viewpoint: conceptual UML class / dependency model.
' Operations describe responsibilities; they are not invented callable APIs.
' Reference visual only: Opsy 09-opsy-skill-config-dataflow.svg.
!include _b2b-technical-style.puml
title
<size:30><b>Blog 内容生产系统 · UML 全景类图</b></size>
<size:17><color:#64748B>配置与角色 · 数据选题 · 资料检索 · 写作与排版 · 配图与内链 · 校验 · 授权交付 · 效果复盘</color></size>
end title
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F6F9FC
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam defaultFontColor #17243A
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #52667E
skinparam ArrowFontColor #475569
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 62
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam packageFontSize 19
skinparam packageFontStyle bold
skinparam ClassAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ClassBorderThickness 1.4
skinparam ClassFontStyle bold
skinparam ClassAttributeFontColor #334155
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 17
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8D8
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B89B56
skinparam NoteFontColor #4B4634
