Composer -[hidden]down-> Body

Composer -[dashed,norank]-> Writing : 应用六类文章设计

' Static relationships: solid = named association; dotted = uses / creates.
Role -[dashed,norank]-> Profile : 读取站点与表达配置
Role -[dashed,norank]-> DecisionRules
Runtime -[dashed,norank]-> Context : 读取任务上下文
Planner -[dashed,norank]-> Score : data_backed：消费既有评分
Planner -[dashed,norank]-> FAQ : faq_seeded：无排名冷启动
Planner -[dashed,norank]-> Context : 查重 / 归属 / 冷却期
Planner -[dashed,norank]-> EditorialRules
Research -[dashed,norank]-> Claims : 按主张查询证据
Research -[dashed,norank]-> Context : 读取目标页面与素材
Research -[dashed,norank]-> DecisionRules
Brief -[dashed,norank]-> Audience : 采用受众字段
Brief -[dashed,norank]-> FAQ : FAQ 使用记录
Brief -[dashed,norank]-> Claims : 主张必须对应证据
Brief -[dashed,norank]-> DecisionRules
Composer -[dashed,norank]-> EditorialRules
Composer -[dashed,norank]-> SearchRules
Design -down- Package : 文章包关联的类型与叙事
Body -down- Package : 正文
Meta -down- Package : 元信息
Media -down- Package : 媒体
Links -down- Package : 内部路径
Coverage -down- Package : 问题覆盖
Package -[dashed,norank]-> Brief : 引用相邻简报
Validator -[dashed,norank]-> DeliveryRules
WriteGate -[dashed,norank]-> Package : 读取精确变更
WriteGate -[dashed,norank]-> Result : 须通过适用检查
WriteGate -[dashed,norank]-> DeliveryRules
